        "t-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>César’s Coffee Cup connects coffee lovers directly with the people and places behind exceptional coffee.</p><p>With roots in Colombia and a family history in coffee growing, we source directly from growers we know and work with, including coffee from César’s own farm. Our relationships extend across Colombia and other renowned coffee-growing regions, giving us access to distinctive, traceable coffees selected for their quality, character and origin.</p><p>By working closer to the source, we know where our coffee comes from, who grew it and the story behind each lot. It also allows us to build long-term relationships with producers and bring their coffee to Australia with fewer steps in between.</p><p>From our roastery in North Williamstown, Melbourne, we roast to order and supply coffee to roasters, cafés, businesses and people brewing at home. Whether it’s green coffee for a roaster, a wholesale program for a café, or freshly roasted beans delivered to your door, the connection to origin remains the same.</p><p>From our growers to your cup.</p>"
